s/mirage/mirage_sand_phantom.png","className":"mirage_sand_phantom","description":"Active: <span class=\"highlight\">Consume</span> all Djinn Marks to deal their damage now.","descriptionRu":"Активное: <span class=\"highlight\">поглощает</span> все метки, чтобы нанести мгновенный урон.","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"3733594387","name":"Fire Scarabs","nameRu":"Огненные скарабеи","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/mirage/mirage_fire_beetles.png","className":"mirage_fire_beetles","description":"Infest an enemy with fire scarabs, stealing life from them and causing them to deal reduced damage.","descriptionRu":"Мираж насылает на врага огненных скарабеев, которые крадут у него здоровье и снижают наносимый им урон.","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"2604653402","name":"Traveler","nameRu":"Путник","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/mirage/mirage_teleport.png","className":"mirage_teleport","description":"Target a location on the minimap. After a brief wait, <span class=\"highlight\">teleport</span> to that location. Taking damage or being Stunned, Immobilized, put to Sleep or Movement Silenced during the wait period causes the teleport to be interrupted.<br><br>After teleporting, gain a <span class=\"highlight\">Barrier</span>.","descriptionRu":"Выберите точку на мини-карте. После короткой задержки вы <span class=\"highlight\">телепортируетесь</span> в указанное место. Если во время задержки вы получите урон или попадёте под действия оглушения, обездвиживания, сна или безмолвия, телепортация будет прервана.<br><br>После телепортации вы получаете <span class=\"highlight\">барьер</span>.","abilityType":"ultimate"},{"id":"2573821048","name":"Knocked off Zipline","nameRu":"Падение с зиплайна","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_zip_line","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1466127517","name":"Jump","nameRu":"Прыжок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_jump","descrip